OL,3,GNEWSAEmpowerment tools - how DIY
OL,4,Aclasses for women are more than just
OL,5,Apractical
OL,6,
OL,7,FLearning how to put up a shelf or
OL,8,Frepair garden furniture might be
OL,9,Fpractical, but one group of women
OL,10,Ftaking DIY classes say it can be much
OL,11,Fmore than just a means to an end.
OL,13,FMen's sheds - spaces for men to get
OL,14,Ftogether and learn or develop their
OL,15,Fpractical skills while enjoying a sense
OL,16,Fof community - have become increasingly
OL,17,Fcommon in recent years.
OL,19,FBut the organisers of a "hen's shed"
OL,20,Fhave said they have been delighted at
OL,21,Fthe uptake from women wanting to do the
OL,22,Fsame.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
