OL,3,GNEWSAEmpowerment tools - how DIY
OL,4,Aclasses for women are more than just
OL,5,Apractical
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe women taking part in classes say
OL,8,Fgetting to grips with power tools and
OL,9,Fjoinery is empowering, good for their
OL,10,Fmental health and has a whole host of
OL,11,Fother benefits.
